# {1}{B} left with a Mox Pearl and a Mox Ruby, neither black: 20 down to 18, and its Ornithopter gets -5/-5 and dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Cruelclaw's Heist
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Dismember
Island x20

